SUMMARY:Tejaswini Bhava Abhiyan
DESCRIPTION:Tejaswini Bhava Abhiyan — A girls and women only event. Tejas
 wini Abhiyaan is a community initiative organised by Shri Yog Vedant Seva 
 Samiti\, in association with the Mahila Utthan Mandal wing of Sant Shri As
 haram Ji Ashram\, with the aim of empowering girls and young women by nurt
 uring confidence\, positive thinking\, inner strength\, self-belief\, and 
 a strong sense of purpose. The word Tejaswini describes a girl who embodie
 s tejas (inner radiance)\, confidence\, positivity\, courage\, self-esteem
  and inner strength. The initiative is founded on the belief that every gi
 rl possesses unique strengths\, abilities and potential that can be nurtur
 ed and developed. Just as a small seed contains the potential to grow into
  a magnificent tree\, every individual has the potential for growth and ex
 cellence. In the same way\, every girl has a Tejaswini within her. Tejaswi
 ni Abhiyaan seeks to encourage girls to recognise their strengths\, discov
 er their potential and develop the confidence to make a positive contribut
 ion to their families\, communities and society. Through educational\, cul
 tural\, creative and community activities\, the initiative promotes positi
 ve values\, confidence\, leadership\, self-awareness\, personal developmen
 t and an appreciation of Indian cultural heritage\, traditions and values.
  The initiative provides an encouraging environment where girls can learn\
 , participate\, express themselves\, develop their abilities and build con
 fidence while connecting with cultural traditions and the wider community.
  The vision of Tejaswini Abhiyaan is simple: to inspire every girl to disc
 over\, nurture and awaken the Tejaswini within her.
